IDReader for iOS
Copyright (c) 2026 Christian Auer and Stefan Hellweger.

A port of the Android application CIEreader (cauer71/AndroidDev,
apps/cie-reader) to Apple platforms. Reads the Italian electronic identity card
CIE 3.0 and the ePassport over NFC, and the Italian driving licence from a
photograph.

